  "attribution": "來源：《焦氏易林》，易學網《焦氏易林［四庫全書版］》（依據版本：《欽定四庫全書》子部術數類），https://www.eee-learning.com/book/giauii 。依來源要求標示出處及原網頁連結；本站僅整理林辭原文，並記錄收錄、標點及文字整理修改。",
  "entryCount": 64,
  "missingTargets": [],
  "entries": [
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 28,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 28,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 28,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 28,
      "hexagramName": "大過",
      "poemText": "典冊法書，藏在蘭臺。雖遭亂潰，獨不遇災。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:6e82bb0e4080b4133011294b4a656a42f9b821580a5fac5153310ebc96e0e8ea",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:8ce7471177d1221f4b4531c3f3f8258292e4cd92fc1ebff5adec3c4325865e7c"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 28,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 1,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 1,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 1,
      "hexagramName": "乾",
      "poemText": "日在北陸，陰蔽陽目。萬物空虛，不見長育。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:6f2371db07e0829f4c2bb753230add88298bf2e5b4ceb178244aa08017fa34b7",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:eeb4746ae1f8e8f8baaf65cec8bf04d07ac1b947124dcf3a28bae956c16bd3b3"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 28,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 2,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 2,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 2,
      "hexagramName": "坤",
      "poemText": "鬼泣哭社，悲商無後。甲子昧爽，殷人絕祀。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:f375e4bbda7a77b7bb98d8043ac16903147df62af119855ca858594fd0a6d3f8",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:a242685694e56bb5dd3ed29ba37fc5ec7664638346790a33497572464b99ad3d"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 28,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 3,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 3,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 3,
      "hexagramName": "屯",
      "poemText": "涉塗履危，不利有為。安坐垂堂，乃無災殃。門戶自開，君憂不昌。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:ce035a127c51229c929da040ffdc61ac438253db136df100800463fe760aee83",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:d2b55d4341d586a452a34c67997f953f974aa57b468c0c6d0f3159f71866bfde"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 28,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 4,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 4,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 4,
      "hexagramName": "蒙",
      "poemText": "陽失其紀，枯木復起。秋華冬實，君不得失。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:cd780909ec050ec4ac593077b0be20d3c698fe006dfe8976edee5974767fe339",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:07da283ab5b5bda40d26762c68190338ddfc3a7da6955df587043c190cd72510"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 28,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 5,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 5,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 5,
      "hexagramName": "需",
      "poemText": "大樹之子，百條共母。當夏六月，枝葉盛茂。鸞鳳以庇，召伯避暑。翩翩偃仰，各得其所。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:896b52c5ee3af382f818c0bdde9a1b45a26c373b02db257f9344c37356e7e03f",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:5a973b534543f565ab042693f9a36e85ff9d99deb50689b4cb245e7f345f99b6"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 28,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 6,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 6,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 6,
      "hexagramName": "訟",
      "poemText": "秉鉞執殳，挑戰先驅。不役元帥，敗破為憂。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:ad8cc6ccd3b098171ac270ada8059c7c75d7aaf134c82e80a6ce8a867c62e4e0",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:8baf4e8093a0d881051d19a4ce7f9261bbe6d3ab4751cd0c3d6df5661ccc89f1"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 28,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 7,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 7,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 7,
      "hexagramName": "師",
      "poemText": "啟室開門，巡狩釋冤。夏臺羑里，湯文悅喜。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:91775f2c0fad11fadc52fd3bb05c4d539879bf1828a9eb93e43ec818fea436ba",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:74c566ef76e846cd691dcf63d2eda0c0b34471101c2cef3ee517754a32033ef1"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 28,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 8,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 8,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 8,
      "hexagramName": "比",
      "poemText": "衰滅無幾，淵溺在項。吠狗夜驚，家乃不寧。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:d68c21860cb3dac41b359b0a0379dc86928d083f4fb6805143ee18e9c6708fbe",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:cbb7b6d7e95a21ab6892e71d3dce8cad3cb9a4c450f42efc0c2c4dd863f7fe83"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 28,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 9,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 9,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 9,
      "hexagramName": "小畜",
      "poemText": "西鄰小女，未有所許。志如委衣，不出房戶。心無所處，傅母何咎。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:9558cd9550e373f21c43fa549a0e3804a3ca66c67bd5938e3a13837f481d1f1d",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:9aff4b3f0e70550cd60f7c756a97cb6ff77631c6c416d40aef43a3027321fb0e"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 28,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 10,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 10,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 10,
      "hexagramName": "履",
      "poemText": "狗吠夜驚，履鬼頭頸。危者弗傾，患者不成。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:02b7d9eec88f0a93c5c731f691e08ae8ea26b7e6965dafa47b21e11b17af5303",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:19b44c2f1efd2b796b118c121ead971ab61e197bbb6d91c7065719273b6108dd"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 28,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 11,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 11,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 11,
      "hexagramName": "泰",
      "poemText": "當年少寡，獨與孤處。雞鳴犬吠，無敢難者。我生不辰，獨嬰寒苦。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:0cc84999bd96f601c55555035e4b346ab89bf916322b13897a6f92749261c85b",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:39d2135395749d802c1b9f6f98f182bbc29f1776855ca1d2079ccaf55d883d0e"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 28,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 12,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 12,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 12,
      "hexagramName": "否",
      "poemText": "無道之君，鬼哭其門。命與下國，絕不得食。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:d68aa60c697990420727bb3febe21b70c169558ad4768711808b4014ef255b3e",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:e147855500b5b9d733c4fe17e524953ef54b34d5fd583cc3dd8fe7d0809ec948"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 28,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 13,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 13,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 13,
      "hexagramName": "同人",
      "poemText": "乘龍南遊，夜過糟丘，脫厄增憂。一下有繒絕魯傷，羿不得美。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:d397f15cf92506f486d958201a2b2372d14b2d93fcc030718ae7fb96723feacd",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:d975492b876929e219c39ef8585227a8e057a2def38a7cec7e1eb92e94ab4246"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 28,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 14,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 14,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 14,
      "hexagramName": "大有",
      "poemText": "馬躓車傷，長舌破家。東關二五，晉君出走。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:aae1840faec3114e980d2123b177aa8a5019518412e96b8011c5cfe482d9dd99",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:7a388e39587073e57e5145abea8e7e24dd53d55475eb1927d15d98c7f24a2a8d"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 28,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 15,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 15,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 15,
      "hexagramName": "謙",
      "poemText": "瓜花瓠實，百女同室。醯苦不熟，未有配合。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:7e018ce293e1ac653a578d9a24be77717541bb8a43c3d0e1ec24ddf14598ea36",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:55c84c94d761237dd19dd858054ffbe5616685663b751863614ceb6c83ba9944"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 28,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 16,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 16,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 16,
      "hexagramName": "豫",
      "poemText": "晨風文翰，火舉就溫。時過我邑，羿無所得。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:6442fd766c0a99cbe57f464e481ab88bd042ca9fd362ef1416cc225e1e626a46",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:d8e3f1e59a97f0371d23153aa34a87b6248521275e2bd3d6c59fef81eeccbec5"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 28,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 17,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 17,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 17,
      "hexagramName": "隨",
      "poemText": "浼浼促促，塗泥至轂。雨濘不進，虎囓不得。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:87983c44571ba5ed7ea5202138ae20f6e19d463c59a79e9c9bf3f9bb22e0f429",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:f63078aafce9903b08bb767334e85eaf6c1f9a5a6dd338e7e181513aafda39e2"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 28,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 18,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 18,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 18,
      "hexagramName": "蠱",
      "poemText": "膠車駕東，與雨相逢。放革懈惰，頓禹（一作輸）獨坐。憂不為禍。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:7a59e16af477f655bc4d0a2c3e6afb7b2826b47c7737b58fc8d12963543ee620",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:3889fe3d86bf26ab5788bc8683f2b407a2d8353ec1f9e48993f42c1d273ee77e"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 28,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 19,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 19,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 19,
      "hexagramName": "臨",
      "poemText": "六家作權，公室剖分。陰制其陽，唐叔失明。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:3bb039055ca6a7356c47982337935152a1f4f356ed6a879b2ec504f3384b5d3f",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:7ba08fc6b52c706d02093025ba0a57a14562ea6c752e0c9ba502815c652df242"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 28,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 20,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 20,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 20,
      "hexagramName": "觀",
      "poemText": "去室離家，來奔大都。火息復明，姬伯以昌。商人失功。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:7c37a653ff7f6932658742267caa69759adb88939eeeec8852d776662ffd32f1",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:a1d1002def2d949ab7e706328d9336eb6da49929748c1fddfd5f03ce154f9c59"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 28,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 21,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 21,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 21,
      "hexagramName": "噬嗑",
      "poemText": "牧羊稻園，聞虎喧讙。危懼喘息，終無禍患。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:cee3af8fcda6e67879c1dca4b58c18d079e1a9060d176930612d811ec9206424",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:de953df025c5ca0fec1214dc78b27f559c1684daa53d53e2e5e08a04a75a2ab7"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 28,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 22,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 22,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 22,
      "hexagramName": "賁",
      "poemText": "嬰兒求乳，母歸其子。黃麑悅喜，乃得甘飽。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:407310a46388b20ebfd6af1c3724a68931bea5a39e5348ff15594ccaf7957a2b",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:8d420376a0e47b419825cc84854df46e7187b2f0741f1eb315cf7e7b4416bfc6"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 28,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 23,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 23,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 23,
      "hexagramName": "剝",
      "poemText": "廓落失業，跨禍變福，利無所得。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:b72ab0afeb21c5ce52077b0eb7f876ca5c6b823b3ea8e0aaf4988a5d4d3d59e1",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:4fec42d032327f7f1af72c72f3e78756cb493992ae877d39189373e667a602d9"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 28,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 24,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 24,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 24,
      "hexagramName": "復",
      "poemText": "出入無時，憂患為災。行人失牛，利去不來。若馬遺駒，勿與久居。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:cddd20c90366fe6f0e030c2920de12a980c0cf74f55b25fe94d27fedfddf3f8e",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:35a3503efeea5aa6135e03d3f03b6f5347922992345370d9394828731cdc1462"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 28,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 25,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 25,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 25,
      "hexagramName": "无妄",
      "poemText": "風怒漂木，女感生疾。陽失其時，陰孽為賊。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:d7ca4eb74c4e6033b191cd634f589a1088cb6df2fff7b53ce0c04140a1ae4c26",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:1e2e6d4285b47c721ff68ed6812e06cff7f4db0498306b7c2efa910a4687ce84"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 28,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 26,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 26,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 26,
      "hexagramName": "大畜",
      "poemText": "車馬疾傷，不利越鄉。幽人無貪，去晦就明。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:caeb4993a027dd0c8fe5066d8e05da174ae620029d214669acdb0f103654491f",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:b522b27fc16fb8d50d7a1f6002a9017a6a2f1038f84f3a90d3ab7d40eb7fc549"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 28,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 27,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 27,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 27,
      "hexagramName": "頤",
      "poemText": "三奇六耦，各有所主。周南召南，聖人所在。德義流行，民悅以喜。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:7b51322bb1e4a9ce8c97592dd895e34c3f9196a5b1fb30c52f7bd30bf7d9b0c2",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:258c383041395c816d61cf5d603514673c96d22b717392218c3d1502f5fa5427"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 28,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 29,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 29,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 29,
      "hexagramName": "坎",
      "poemText": "坐爭立訟，紛紛哅哅。卒成禍亂，災及家公。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:633d01e77dc130ab50adad2f98998e4f7547def12b5608e525f8d34e99f7a920",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:d317c46a0bd14f41cc524d81dc032d1c1d87b5c28ba50f68303c717446a6fd7c"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 28,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 30,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 30,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 30,
      "hexagramName": "離",
      "poemText": "凶憂為殘，使我不安。從之南國，以除心疾。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:9b75fcf580190b96afc15aeeaf8619192527a5234663c224da270b2d9838b00a",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:8022b54c8af4055d5789f554c69c6a7133c124fc964c199b24dcdb525a95b166"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 28,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 31,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 31,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 31,
      "hexagramName": "咸",
      "poemText": "愛我嬰女，牽引不得。冀幸高貴，反曰下賤。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:66976ce50b4f1f661c2c814801c3db17aafc9df407516c8522df8954ccc75dc4",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:db5ce009b65ab01b04bd56fbfb86aae0572f670e9b570a15e7aef4184e907788"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 28,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 32,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 32,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 32,
      "hexagramName": "恒",
      "poemText": "宜行賈市，所取必倍。載喜抱子，與利為友。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:352d03761ba13b582e519fc6f2558918de890136178e6379fdd2af1d1ba1302f",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:c4e0ab5a42eeebbe323255acbe387d1215a0b8e032bb5b4ee978ebed14b4f63f"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 28,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 33,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 33,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 33,
      "hexagramName": "遯",
      "poemText": "坐席未溫，憂來扣門。踰牆北走，兵交我後。脫於虎口。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:cb80058c8f5742babd271c6e82c26a1562026ed216d10051aeceaf591623ed0c",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:e4499f829a1b9c56e233ed84a642b5fffd0647d379e6d271fce59e105fff7f67"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 28,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 34,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 34,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 34,
      "hexagramName": "大壯",
      "poemText": "赤帝懸車，廢職不朝。叔帶之災，君子記廬。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:36b443adcef9f71b3a7a14fc208dde7b58ce8de0cd580867ae292ce6763e6f8a",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:d8a3a48028cb96314aa1c1d2daf983458473e834e983e0dea4c0925a5fb4f216"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 28,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 35,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 35,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 35,
      "hexagramName": "晉",
      "poemText": "子畏於匡，厄困陳蔡。明德不危，竟自免害。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:1e18f761c83121eb6b5b9b79506a6456fad8d86610135aa17c46aaf8e98da1f1",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:2042a8bdcab355389af310c04a6349f1306ddfad05f389daa86b3799314cddfb"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 28,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 36,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 36,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 36,
      "hexagramName": "明夷",
      "poemText": "逐雁南飛，馬疾牛罷。不見魚池，失利憂危。牢戶之冤，脫免無患。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:ff21ab1da2376dd141432a883661a65c35ef185dea9f4c9fcd32876085f28075",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:a87c13731c3f8fa6a881a8579fcce2484a3fa749a3a43c7951af55dc75948df3"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 28,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 37,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 37,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 37,
      "hexagramName": "家人",
      "poemText": "推輦上山，高仰重難。終日至暮，不見阜巔。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:0785c7141f6fb320e741c83ae3440710f4fd0858a3dca7d3171bbc5ff23fb3aa",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:1789b8605dd7648c2b5d9a732d5e80443b64fd28068ef642505652257a72a86a"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 28,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 38,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 38,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 38,
      "hexagramName": "睽",
      "poemText": "憂不為患，福在堂門，使君偃安。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:36b7c2ca183e926c6cfb597589904a9917c8f92827163845817266eb3e10b7e3",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:4284c32f9886cc2f6a23db6dab9b832823a309913d3357682ffedc30c8b723db"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 28,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 39,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 39,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 39,
      "hexagramName": "蹇",
      "poemText": "春桃生華，季女宜家。受福多年，男為邦君。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:78991928b343f7f5496b98c6cd0849532c0556ef9bd16237be036f78a945182f",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:79dc7e98792dea1b09eaf7cf377c2ef86740266c06d6e11f416a8bfed263df2d"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 28,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 40,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 40,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 40,
      "hexagramName": "解",
      "poemText": "高山之巔，去地億千。雖有兵寇，足以自守。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:990b34f416d9e8cdc74c48ed4d1c9936ec3ffadfd95cc0d034478dee555dc3a0",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:a88e781ebec784c748ce223e46e93c847ad46c628a2eb37b5e52f5a97c1b4f74"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 28,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 41,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 41,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 41,
      "hexagramName": "損",
      "poemText": "過時歷月，役夫憔悴。處子嘆室，思我伯叔。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:c8580072c2d7a6c5fddd00c6cee543a583addde3d97f82b7659e1977d2874375",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:6abf6d58c397e6224691bee4d96f49db81096f8ec3e77925ac5e8055fe5e466b"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 28,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 42,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 42,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 42,
      "hexagramName": "益",
      "poemText": "太微復明，說升傅巖，乃稱高宗。一作疾在頭頸，和不能生，滅其令名。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:c77e1cc22c223808501f18fbdf4da9e2a6c4a121134ab19101f28921abc7eb14",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:ef47ad9e0957a1eb8399d86d9f04172f948345b75242c30ade477f36fa2a2a30"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 28,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 43,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 43,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 43,
      "hexagramName": "夬",
      "poemText": "旁多小星，三五在東。早夜晨行，勞苦無功。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:d693454e5b9d2591aa0fbf71761605f0a5b4407b87ddf4e9c3727c2d47dfb485",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:548b6de84166423137c65b758065c180a75ff036155edd454828d8105a510b90"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 28,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 44,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 44,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 44,
      "hexagramName": "姤",
      "poemText": "東鄉煩煩，相與笑言。子般鞭革，圉人作患。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:991a9a16bc7e495272d4cb421928fac7883b51cf3ff916200e4ec0936049cfaf",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:4a8fbe3a4d4fa4c7e3021e0d5d5a0feb40e7705d8eb06536e7a94201cc478fc7"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 28,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 45,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 45,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 45,
      "hexagramName": "萃",
      "poemText": "鼻移在頭，枯葦復生。下朽上榮，家乃不寧。其舍不成。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:ee336e7542a932700736f4bdb967bc17ceae43f4c2c1ee5990adb71c138756a1",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:a4b6f94a50a0aa9c8621bfe95791dfb58a5eddb85f59ca881e7779f7e0dfbcea"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 28,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 46,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 46,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 46,
      "hexagramName": "升",
      "poemText": "蝦蟆群聚，從天請雨。雲雷集聚，應時輒與。得其所願。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:63176b1ca2c5fe0234a1e79a0972249f8171dc2e6473745ae8b0fc6dfc031c6d",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:5e2420a1b3842aa300ac9e488283e7fa4094471f109c2d93d40a6a2098f185ec"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 28,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 47,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 47,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 47,
      "hexagramName": "困",
      "poemText": "大步上車，南到喜家。送我貂裘，與福載來。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:5e19668bdcab3e04947bfaf7dcbab6c7add7366181ffd368d4cf6eedcd03cdd6",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:11e1cb8a14c7339345a8b668a9dd7a57663242a895d23e91ee6cb96e31003fb4"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 28,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 48,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 48,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 48,
      "hexagramName": "井",
      "poemText": "賊仁傷德，天怒不福。斬刈宗社，失其土宇。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:e7f1400af3761ab59b5baee3708ad228eaf19582c6032552cdf1868b98c9c645",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:d03a643fa94ef3b71c5481ef98131f972f6501bf7bd67b30492a11d2e3abacb0"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 28,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 49,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 49,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 49,
      "hexagramName": "革",
      "poemText": "從猬見虎，雖危無殆，終已不處。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:138197897aaac6805302268862a0f1b9e63ce3b8696249b359df66b154691c3b",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:b2a29a4a7d2bdd9ad6b2f0fe1ffd7ed700a577af3c9d9604d1ec969b24f03f1b"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 28,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 50,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 50,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 50,
      "hexagramName": "鼎",
      "poemText": "履行素德，卒蒙祐福。與堯侑食，君子有息。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:d82c3bcf62e6bedace2ea5d4b48c0b81516fe8f6fd34f2b6b4c5b4366275cb8b",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:691bd949d0652144186050b8b4f36cc943481ebc7478f8833cbec9d43d4c35d1"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 28,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 51,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 51,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 51,
      "hexagramName": "震",
      "poemText": "利在北陸，寒苦難得。憂危之患，福為道門。商叔生存。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:85d8be75492a2d81ff9ecbde02146c9696d92c9660f5881404f82f784a0e9749",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:e557089df39a75df9f3879df0a9193de79e65603dc626d059ebd0e02e319e923"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 28,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 52,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 52,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 52,
      "hexagramName": "艮",
      "poemText": "四蹇六盲，足痛難行。終日至暮，不離其鄰。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:df0c0568d2b434ecfd3bcb5519fff014e3400bcd52e374155058c4ccdc100600",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:f26bd0ccd621e0a17f75c0b97860b4a2b38a44d9815b2edcfdd5df8632ebaa9c"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 28,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 53,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 53,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 53,
      "hexagramName": "漸",
      "poemText": "臺駘昧子，明知地理。障澤宣德，封居河涘。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:e888a82aadc2c4f87bc1e906da6403216a161097fd8278f8281ce6c596c73f02",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:d3013059f305c54a3afbe8e27e74da6a92d0cf0c7f485fb1c6b87dd81348fd7f"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 28,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 54,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 54,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 54,
      "hexagramName": "歸妹",
      "poemText": "畜水待時，以備火災。柱車絆馬，郊行出旅。可以無咎。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:743030b1a1552b48ab5b54063417e13ea6000232b687df35373eb8ba48a8c164",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:433599525ea55f87294075ede8ac98e6588b2d6527217725fcb64f278e12ca11"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 28,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 55,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 55,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 55,
      "hexagramName": "豐",
      "poemText": "歲暮花落，君衰於德。榮寵殞墜，陰棄其室。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:a50d14046662d299e0386fdf5f74c67be2746e4bcee92500a5eeca61d57283cf",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:3672540d65a14067ed559dcc346dfed168ced47f9889688c93681218fc56a4fe"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 28,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 56,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 56,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 56,
      "hexagramName": "旅",
      "poemText": "夏敗蔡悲，千里為市。黃落潱鬱，利得無有。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:1ca56f52765936d7a50f7b375d229ec3494343d96688256b2788ecddc25a3075",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:a454ac8f2c48867bfea47fdce6cf1c6d11e48677ef243b969864e6fef1561a69"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 28,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 57,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 57,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 57,
      "hexagramName": "巽",
      "poemText": "仲春巡狩，東見群后。昭德允明，不失其所。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:1d8b32996efef271fbd401b6b4b4a964cf484417307ccb7d9d528515519bff39",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:92b49032cfa736796ad82555893ca730629aa04e4f3c3d98a7fcad3325cdf5cc"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 28,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 58,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 58,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 58,
      "hexagramName": "兌",
      "poemText": "冽潔縲縲，締搆難解。嫫母衒嫁，媒不得坐。自為身禍。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:8b7d9bfb596d6f995638d8c5720d3236e51e69c7a2722f8755ae684ad1841d0b",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:39dbc7eef223c176327196b8d6675ea3d7e5ff43d6a602618829239329baeec1"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 28,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 59,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 59,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 59,
      "hexagramName": "渙",
      "poemText": "鳥嚕夜中，以戒災凶。重門擊柝，備憂外客。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:f2fc8c9de037560868b1d41d368d1445ab4a57e1c8e952fb134312224510e328",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:412c79d697736c234b001d06a59c75685db31958dcfc86bac988973c2bb8fe9d"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 28,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 60,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 60,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 60,
      "hexagramName": "節",
      "poemText": "朝霽暮露，纖我衣濡，道無行牛。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:eba8a377e2f86b170e3261fe342ee4df4c28945ad44cdc3633b66cf3563b4cdd",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:1263825c6c77b618bf78aae6cd97a648de557b1674f2ec78e98ab860231c27ae"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 28,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 61,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 61,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 61,
      "hexagramName": "中孚",
      "poemText": "抱璞懷玉，與桀跖觴。詘坐不申，道無良人。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:f4d909a6058bbd1c43645fd1cda0b6d52f15071ee2b491b284fe5adc24616905",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:30ee28361dc2554de715f593265108ed7bfd8b508fa9f9d239fc43a270c5f71e"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 28,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 62,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 62,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 62,
      "hexagramName": "小過",
      "poemText": "兩心相悅，共其茀 。一作茅蘆）夙夜在公，不離房中。得君子意。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:1c1144309e8084756dd719914f6fcbeac398f2a729c0d05a4e0611f4e3341dc1",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:6d857df3859456ce196cf4756e56477ef82803e52706d34d8c106bcdc147e1c0"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 28,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 63,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 63,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 63,
      "hexagramName": "既濟",
      "poemText": "載餽茹田，破鉏失餐。苗稼不闢，獨飢於年。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:47fb857c3b87f180d0addbe7dc213c28e0c972fb56f045970a4c6b628961d3f5",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:968c57e72365c753be539dac64d92f0674cca743c591d3cfc10da815c3abd5a8"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 28,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 64,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 64,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 64,
      "hexagramName": "未濟",
      "poemText": "甘露醴泉，太平機關。仁德感應，歲樂民安。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:db60484ca4bd913cf2c07bf702e77e0003c254991b01968f3ec126ac47e9addc",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:3470f5fbb8955747676dfa44a292e438454755f30e88f79f7bf02df9d64cbe92"
    }
  ]
}
